# ─── Local staging for review — never commit ─────────────────────────────────
Cestino/

# ─── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
ENV/

# ─── IDE / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ─── Heavy simulation output — archived on Zenodo, not in git ────────────────
# HDF5 velocity fields: 17 MB / 129 MB / 510 MB for the three Run 3 levels,
# plus 8.8 GB from the archived Run 2. Far beyond GitHub's 100 MB file limit.
*.h5

# Per-rank MPI checkpoint arrays
*.npy

# ─── Meshes are regenerated, not shipped ─────────────────────────────────────
# src/mesh.py is deterministic and verifies what gmsh actually delivered, so the
# recipe is the reproducible artefact. The .msh binaries total 49 MB; their
# measured properties are kept as the small *.json files next to them.
*.msh
*.msh.bak
*.opt
*.pos

# ─── ParaView / VTK intermediates (final GIFs under media/ ARE tracked) ──────
*.vtu
*.vtp
*.pvd
*.bp/
*.mp4

# ─── Archives ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
